WEBVTT

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:11.060
Yugi Muto assembled the Millennium Puzzle and became the guardian of the Shadow Games.

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:17.260
Pegasus has a Millennium Item of his own - the Millennium Eye.

00:00:17.260 --> 00:00:21.800
Yugi accepts Pegasus's challenge and goes to Duelist Kingdom.

00:00:23.650 --> 00:00:28.010
Pegasus stole his grandfather Sugoroku's soul, and Yugi intends to rescue him.

00:00:28.740 --> 00:00:33.850
He battles alongside his trusted friends and with his other self.

00:00:39.230 --> 00:00:44.300
I can't finish reading the magazine pages

00:00:46.220 --> 00:00:51.210
I get the feeling that I must read it

00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:57.960
Game cartridges are stacked in the corner of the room

00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:04.660
Is there no meaning if I don't play them?

00:01:06.890 --> 00:01:09.760
You're on the other side of the table

00:01:10.210 --> 00:01:13.130
I'm talking to you, but...

00:01:13.730 --> 00:01:20.060
You don't change your facial expression at all

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:26.310
Even though I'm this close to you

00:01:26.810 --> 00:01:33.580
These feelings don't reach you, don't reach you

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:40.320
What is truly precious?

00:01:44.350 --> 00:01:46.520
Mokuba, are you okay?

00:01:47.640 --> 00:01:51.330
Big brother, I didn't give the key to anyone.

00:01:52.480 --> 00:01:53.770
Mokuba!

00:01:53.770 --> 00:01:56.620
I protected Kaiba Corporation.

00:01:56.620 --> 00:01:58.760
Just wait.  I'll get you out immediately.

00:02:03.840 --> 00:02:08.900
Bravo.  What a touching reunion.

00:02:08.900 --> 00:02:10.280
Pegasus.

00:02:22.350 --> 00:02:23.760
Mokuba!

00:02:27.200 --> 00:02:28.390
What's that?

00:02:28.390 --> 00:02:31.630
This is a Soul Prison card.

00:02:31.630 --> 00:02:36.570
I'm keeping Mokuba boy's soul.

00:02:36.570 --> 00:02:37.550
What?

00:02:37.550 --> 00:02:42.130
If you want Mokuba boy back, you must defeat me in a duel.

00:02:42.130 --> 00:02:45.240
Fine!  I'll take you on right now!

00:02:46.080 --> 00:02:50.430
Challenge me now?  You're asking for too much.

00:02:50.430 --> 00:02:54.040
You must first duel Yugi boy.

00:02:54.040 --> 00:02:58.710
You can duel me if you defeat Yugi boy.

00:02:59.770 --> 00:03:05.730
Duel of Destiny!
Yugi vs Kaiba

00:03:14.040 --> 00:03:19.550
You cannot duel me unless you defeat Yugi boy.

00:03:19.550 --> 00:03:25.380
And Mokuba boy's soul will never leave this card.

00:03:26.260 --> 00:03:28.840
How dare you, Pegasus!

00:03:35.110 --> 00:03:36.430
What's this for?

00:03:36.620 --> 00:03:39.280
You already know.

00:03:40.400 --> 00:03:46.170
Your destinies are connected, like two ends of a necktie.

00:03:46.350 --> 00:03:50.040
You two are destined to battle.

00:03:50.040 --> 00:03:55.680
The two duelists will once again intersect at a single point.

00:03:55.680 --> 00:03:57.680
You don't mean...

00:03:57.860 --> 00:04:02.960
Yes.  You will wager those Star Chips and duel Yugi boy.

00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:08.970
If you win, you will restore Kaiba Corporation's reputation.

00:04:08.970 --> 00:04:12.600
I will take over your company after that.

00:04:12.600 --> 00:04:15.950
Pegasus, I have no choice but to follow your orders.

00:04:15.950 --> 00:04:22.000
I don't know what trick you pulled, but if anything happens to Mokuba...

00:04:22.570 --> 00:04:27.330
I'll choke you with your "necktie of destiny!"

00:04:30.750 --> 00:04:33.600
We did it!  We're back to the surface!

00:04:33.600 --> 00:04:35.690
Where on the island are we?

00:04:37.910 --> 00:04:39.240
This is...

00:04:39.240 --> 00:04:40.930
Look.

00:04:40.930 --> 00:04:43.510
That's Pegasus's castle!

00:04:43.510 --> 00:04:44.600
You're right.

00:04:44.830 --> 00:04:47.550
We finally made it here, Yugi.

00:04:48.080 --> 00:04:49.100
Finally.

00:04:51.600 --> 00:04:55.150
Yugi looks kind right now.

00:04:55.770 --> 00:05:00.840
But when he's dueling, he's so serious that it's scary.

00:05:03.110 --> 00:05:07.640
There's a kind-but-clumsy Yugi and a serious-and-scary Yugi.

00:05:07.640 --> 00:05:10.560
It's like there are two Yugis.

00:05:11.550 --> 00:05:15.280
I've seen two Yugis once before.

00:05:17.420 --> 00:05:20.310
There are two Yugis?

00:05:20.310 --> 00:05:21.700
That's my other self.

00:05:21.860 --> 00:05:27.680
I don't quite understand, but it seems there's a cool Yugi and a regular Yugi.

00:05:29.860 --> 00:05:32.050
You don't have to say it like that!

00:05:32.050 --> 00:05:33.330
Sorry.

00:05:33.330 --> 00:05:36.570
I'll show you that I can be cool too!

00:05:36.820 --> 00:05:38.520
Hey Yugi.

00:05:38.710 --> 00:05:41.020
I'll destroy that hidden enemy.

00:05:41.020 --> 00:05:42.280
Let's battle!

00:05:44.930 --> 00:05:46.430
Wait, Yugi!

00:05:46.430 --> 00:05:47.860
Black Magic!

00:05:49.360 --> 00:05:54.260
Another Yugi?  That must have been a dream.

00:05:54.750 --> 00:05:55.950
What's up?

00:05:55.950 --> 00:05:58.400
It's nothing.

00:05:58.400 --> 00:06:00.930
What are you doing?

00:06:00.930 --> 00:06:03.200
If you don't hurry up, we'll leave you behind.

00:06:03.200 --> 00:06:07.280
But it's pointless if we're the only ones who go to Pegasus's castle.

00:06:07.280 --> 00:06:08.580
You're right.

00:06:08.800 --> 00:06:10.570
Let's go.

00:06:13.860 --> 00:06:18.120
Sheesh.  Due to that incident, I thought you were someone I could count on.

00:06:18.120 --> 00:06:20.530
That incident?

00:06:29.820 --> 00:06:31.910
Welcome!

00:06:31.910 --> 00:06:34.220
A table for two?

00:06:37.550 --> 00:06:40.530
What are they doing here?

00:06:40.530 --> 00:06:42.710
The school forbids having a part-time job.

00:06:42.710 --> 00:06:44.620
If the school finds out, I'll be expelled!

00:06:44.620 --> 00:06:49.150
Jonouchi can't keep a secret!  I'm doomed!

00:06:49.150 --> 00:06:54.220
She works here at Burger World?  I now know her secret.

00:06:54.220 --> 00:06:57.200
This is bad.  I think Anzu is angry.

00:06:57.900 --> 00:07:03.820
Enjoy your hamburgers with plenty of our special ketchup.

00:07:04.500 --> 00:07:06.440
I'll crush you if you tell anyone!

00:07:06.760 --> 00:07:09.010
Why are you working here?

00:07:09.450 --> 00:07:13.860
Since my secret's out, I don't have to hide it from you.

00:07:14.480 --> 00:07:19.060
I'm saving up money so that I can go to America after I graduate.

00:07:19.060 --> 00:07:20.130
America?

00:07:20.130 --> 00:07:20.990
But why?

00:07:20.990 --> 00:07:24.350
Don't laugh.  You see...

00:07:25.820 --> 00:07:28.620
I want to study dance in New York!

00:07:31.680 --> 00:07:33.420
You're not laughing?

00:07:33.860 --> 00:07:35.900
Why would we laugh?

00:07:37.200 --> 00:07:39.370
That's your dream, right?

00:07:39.370 --> 00:07:42.260
That's great!  We'll be rooting for you!

00:07:53.090 --> 00:07:55.910
Meet me in the gym's storage room after school.

00:07:55.910 --> 00:07:59.200
If you don't, I'll reveal your secret.

00:08:00.590 --> 00:08:01.820
No way!

00:08:03.750 --> 00:08:06.830
Jonouchi!  Or was it Yugi?

00:08:06.830 --> 00:08:09.550
I know it's one of you!

00:08:12.070 --> 00:08:17.230
Stay quiet.  If the school finds out about your part-time job, you're expelled!

00:08:17.230 --> 00:08:20.440
If you don't want me to reveal your secret, do what I say!

00:08:20.440 --> 00:08:23.920
You're not going to get away with this!

00:08:24.130 --> 00:08:28.400
A rule breaker like you doesn't have the right to say that.

00:08:29.860 --> 00:08:31.200
Anzu!

00:08:31.200 --> 00:08:32.970
What are you doing to Anzu?

00:08:32.970 --> 00:08:33.530
Shut up!

00:08:34.800 --> 00:08:36.200
Yugi!

00:08:36.960 --> 00:08:38.230
Ouch!

00:08:48.440 --> 00:08:54.220
Since you have the free time to do something this stupid, I'll play with you.

00:08:54.220 --> 00:08:55.230
What?

00:08:55.230 --> 00:08:58.880
If you have the courage, let's play a game.

00:08:59.370 --> 00:09:01.200
A game?

00:09:01.200 --> 00:09:03.330
We each draw a card.

00:09:03.330 --> 00:09:06.690
The one who draws the weakest card loses.

00:09:06.880 --> 00:09:11.430
But whoever loses will be sent to the Shadow Realm.

00:09:11.680 --> 00:09:13.430
What a joke.

00:09:14.400 --> 00:09:15.570
Are you afraid?

00:09:20.400 --> 00:09:24.000
I drew a super powerful card!  Curse of Dragon!

00:09:27.510 --> 00:09:30.340
I drew Dark Magician.

00:09:30.340 --> 00:09:31.650
I win.

00:09:34.040 --> 00:09:36.060
This was just a game!

00:09:36.260 --> 00:09:38.840
Men determine winners based on strength!

00:09:38.840 --> 00:09:41.490
Oh really?  Mind Crush!

00:09:47.780 --> 00:09:51.820
Repent for what you've done by living in a nightmare.

00:09:55.710 --> 00:10:00.150
Yugi, do you remember saving me in the gym?

00:10:02.020 --> 00:10:05.020
When I came to my senses, he was unconscious.

00:10:05.020 --> 00:10:07.020
I don't remember much.

00:10:07.020 --> 00:10:08.830
You're mysterious, Yugi.

00:10:08.830 --> 00:10:11.150
It's like there are two of you.

00:10:11.150 --> 00:10:16.630
The cool-but-scary Yugi and the kind-but-unreliable Yugi.

00:10:17.810 --> 00:10:23.150
I think I transform into a different version sometimes.

00:10:25.330 --> 00:10:27.630
Don't worry about that.

00:10:27.630 --> 00:10:29.910
You'll always be Yugi.

00:10:30.800 --> 00:10:32.180
Anzu.

00:10:32.180 --> 00:10:34.840
Hey, Yugi and Anzu!

00:10:34.840 --> 00:10:37.330
What are you doing?  Hurry up!

00:10:38.060 --> 00:10:39.950
Let's go, Yugi.

00:10:49.830 --> 00:10:51.330
Kaiba!

00:11:15.420 --> 00:11:19.550
Yugi, you gathered ten Star Chips.

00:11:19.550 --> 00:11:20.960
I'm not surprised.

00:11:21.200 --> 00:11:22.570
Kaiba!

00:11:23.020 --> 00:11:24.900
You won't go any further.

00:11:24.900 --> 00:11:27.730
What's wrong, Kaiba?  What's going on?

00:11:27.950 --> 00:11:31.370
I realized what my destiny is on this island.

00:11:31.370 --> 00:11:36.260
Yugi, my existence is not favorable for you.

00:11:36.510 --> 00:11:42.040
When we face each other, the winds of battle swirl forever.

00:11:43.020 --> 00:11:45.650
Kaiba, stop fighting!

00:11:45.860 --> 00:11:48.570
I'll face you, Kaiba!

00:11:48.570 --> 00:11:49.660
I'll crush you!

00:11:50.880 --> 00:11:52.040
You punk!

00:11:52.040 --> 00:11:53.280
Jonouchi, stop it!

00:11:53.280 --> 00:11:56.560
You battled him before, and you were no match for him.

00:11:56.560 --> 00:11:57.550
You're right.

00:11:57.550 --> 00:11:59.330
Bakura, you went too far.

00:12:03.740 --> 00:12:08.880
That loser also gathered ten Star Chips?

00:12:08.880 --> 00:12:12.010
I'll upgrade you from a loser to a nobody.

00:12:12.010 --> 00:12:16.040
A nobody?  How dare you!

00:12:16.040 --> 00:12:17.860
It must be a miracle.

00:12:17.860 --> 00:12:21.600
Since that time, I've been searching for an answer.

00:12:21.600 --> 00:12:24.800
On why I lost my duel against Yugi.

00:12:25.290 --> 00:12:29.110
How did Yugi achieve a miracle?

00:12:29.110 --> 00:12:32.670
I think I found the answer.

00:12:32.670 --> 00:12:36.710
It was something Yugi had and I didn't.

00:12:37.910 --> 00:12:42.970
Does a person become stronger if he has something worth protecting?

00:12:42.970 --> 00:12:47.910
The only way to know for sure is to win the duel.

00:12:48.350 --> 00:12:51.800
Yugi, defeat me if you want to enter the castle!

00:12:51.800 --> 00:12:53.690
This is the duel of destiny!

00:12:53.690 --> 00:12:55.150
Kaiba!

00:12:55.600 --> 00:12:59.950
This Kaiba isn't the Kaiba I knew before.

00:12:59.950 --> 00:13:02.080
There's something different about him.

00:13:02.080 --> 00:13:05.150
Yugi, you can't accept this duel.

00:13:05.150 --> 00:13:08.070
You already have ten Star Chips, so this duel is pointless.

00:13:08.310 --> 00:13:10.970
Yugi, I know you understand.

00:13:10.970 --> 00:13:15.910
Our duelist blood brought us together again!

00:13:15.910 --> 00:13:18.180
Duelist blood?

00:13:26.930 --> 00:13:29.050
It's the other Yugi.

00:13:29.050 --> 00:13:31.320
Fine, Kaiba!

00:13:31.320 --> 00:13:33.460
I accept this duel.

00:13:33.460 --> 00:13:35.090
And I will defeat you.

00:13:36.360 --> 00:13:39.820
Follow me to where we will battle.

00:13:58.350 --> 00:14:00.480
I have ten Star Chips.

00:14:00.690 --> 00:14:01.860
Yes, you do.

00:14:02.130 --> 00:14:05.690
You are permitted to enter Pegasus's castle.

00:14:11.340 --> 00:14:13.700
I'm the first one into Pegasus's castle.

00:14:18.240 --> 00:14:22.930
Yugi, we will both wager five Star Chips in this duel.

00:14:22.930 --> 00:14:26.660
Only the winner can enter Pegasus's castle.

00:14:26.660 --> 00:14:28.170
Fine.

00:14:31.640 --> 00:14:33.690
We'll use Duel Disks in this game.

00:14:33.910 --> 00:14:37.960
Insert your shuffled cards into the left arm holder.

00:14:38.970 --> 00:14:42.130
We start with 2000 life points.  Turn on the counter!

00:14:42.960 --> 00:14:47.030
Yugi, don't lose!  Crush Kaiba!

00:14:47.640 --> 00:14:48.880
Yugi...

00:14:51.200 --> 00:14:58.440
I'll look from the top of the castle to see who'll come here to be my opponent.

00:15:02.170 --> 00:15:06.480
Those kids escaped from the cave?

00:15:06.480 --> 00:15:07.720
Huh?  Who's the other guy?

00:15:08.130 --> 00:15:10.720
Kaiba Corporation's president!

00:15:11.940 --> 00:15:14.970
This should be interesting.

00:15:14.970 --> 00:15:18.170
This will be perfect for killing time.

00:15:23.000 --> 00:15:24.480
Here we go, Yugi!

00:15:24.480 --> 00:15:29.910
We'll use these Duel Disks to determine who's superior in this ultimate card battle!

00:15:29.910 --> 00:15:31.910
I'll take on any duel!

00:15:31.910 --> 00:15:34.780
Kaiba, I will defeat you!

00:15:35.020 --> 00:15:36.050
Duel!

00:15:36.050 --> 00:15:38.400
Here I go!  It's my turn!

00:15:40.570 --> 00:15:43.860
Ryu-Kishin Powered in attack position!

00:15:47.330 --> 00:15:48.530
Look at the cards!

00:15:48.530 --> 00:15:50.880
That didn't happen when we dueled.

00:15:50.880 --> 00:15:52.130
My turn!

00:15:53.820 --> 00:15:56.660
Curse of Dragon in attack position.

00:16:01.140 --> 00:16:07.280
Even though we're battling each other, we have one common goal.

00:16:07.280 --> 00:16:08.780
For Pegasus to lose.

00:16:08.780 --> 00:16:14.790
That's right.  But if that's what you want, you must lose to me.

00:16:14.970 --> 00:16:19.290
Because you are incapable of defeating Pegasus.

00:16:19.290 --> 00:16:20.290
What?

00:16:20.290 --> 00:16:24.350
Pegasus has the ability to read his opponent's mind.

00:16:24.350 --> 00:16:28.930
I don't know if it's his magical power or a trick.

00:16:28.930 --> 00:16:35.460
But I can use these Solid Vision cards to hide myself and my facial expressions.

00:16:35.460 --> 00:16:39.460
Pegasus will be powerless against my Duel Disk!

00:16:39.460 --> 00:16:43.910
Kaiba doesn't realize that Pegasus gets his power from a Millennium Item.

00:16:43.910 --> 00:16:48.450
This Duel Disk System can't defeat a Shadow Game.

00:16:48.450 --> 00:16:50.400
What's wrong, Yugi?

00:16:50.400 --> 00:16:53.090
Try to destroy my Ryu-Kishin Powered.

00:16:53.090 --> 00:16:55.490
Fine.  I'll attack.

00:16:55.680 --> 00:17:00.130
Go, Curse of Dragon!  Attack Ryu-kishin Powered!

00:17:00.710 --> 00:17:02.130
Hell Flame!

00:17:04.270 --> 00:17:07.040
All right!  Ryu-Kishin Powered is destroyed!

00:17:11.060 --> 00:17:13.320
You didn't hesitate to attack me.

00:17:13.320 --> 00:17:19.240
Losing these life points was a small price to pay to confirm that fact.

00:17:20.080 --> 00:17:25.060
All right!  You don't need to be scared by Kaiba's bluffs!

00:17:26.290 --> 00:17:29.640
It's my turn.  I draw a card.

00:17:33.860 --> 00:17:37.400
Come out, Swordstalker.

00:17:37.840 --> 00:17:46.710
The hatred from a fallen ally enters Swordstalker's sword, raising its attack points by 20%.

00:17:48.610 --> 00:17:52.620
What?  It gains attack points due to revenge?

00:17:52.620 --> 00:17:57.120
This is why he let Ryu-Kishin Powered be defeated so easily.

00:17:58.310 --> 00:18:03.370
My monster now has more attack points than Yugi's Curse of Dragon.

00:18:03.630 --> 00:18:07.370
Go, Swordstalker!

00:18:10.770 --> 00:18:13.540
What?  Curse of Dragon vanished?

00:18:13.540 --> 00:18:17.370
I have Monster Replace on my field.

00:18:17.370 --> 00:18:23.950
It replaces the monster on my field with one in my hand that has greater attack points.

00:18:23.950 --> 00:18:25.550
Monster Replace?

00:18:25.550 --> 00:18:29.860
The monster in my hand with the most attack points is Dark Magician!

00:18:29.860 --> 00:18:31.020
Black Magic!

00:18:35.240 --> 00:18:39.150
Dark Magician destroys Swordstalker!

00:18:39.910 --> 00:18:45.110
All right!  Kaiba, don't underestimate Yugi's strength!

00:18:46.040 --> 00:18:50.540
Yugi, I get excited when I duel you.

00:18:50.540 --> 00:18:52.040
It's my turn.

00:18:52.040 --> 00:18:55.460
I play Curse of Dragon again in attack position.

00:18:57.060 --> 00:18:58.320
I end my turn.

00:19:01.820 --> 00:19:03.320
It's my turn.

00:19:03.320 --> 00:19:05.730
La Jinn the Mystical Genie of the Lamp.

00:19:11.420 --> 00:19:13.970
Yugi, it's your turn.

00:19:13.970 --> 00:19:16.970
Dark Magician attacks La Jinn.

00:19:17.200 --> 00:19:18.740
Black Magic!

00:19:18.740 --> 00:19:22.080
I activate the trap card Ancient Lamp!

00:19:28.840 --> 00:19:29.850
What?

00:19:31.850 --> 00:19:36.040
Ancient Lamp reflects the attack back at your monster.

00:19:38.620 --> 00:19:41.020
Curse of Dragon is destroyed.

00:19:56.580 --> 00:20:01.410
Kaiba, you trapped me.  Well done.

00:20:03.020 --> 00:20:06.920
Yugi, I haven't caught you in my real trap yet.

00:20:06.920 --> 00:20:12.430
The most powerful monster is already stirring to life in my hand.

00:20:12.430 --> 00:20:17.330
My goal is to fuse my three Blue-Eyes together!

00:20:33.550 --> 00:20:36.020
Kaiba and Yugi are having a breathtaking duel.

00:20:36.020 --> 00:20:39.110
Be careful!  Kaiba is aiming for something!

00:20:39.110 --> 00:20:41.640
Crush Card Virus!

00:20:41.640 --> 00:20:46.620
Yugi's monsters with high attack points are all destroyed!

00:20:46.620 --> 00:20:48.710
Wait a sec!  What's that?

00:20:48.710 --> 00:20:52.310
He successfully fused three Blue-Eyes?

00:20:52.310 --> 00:20:57.060
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Strongest!  Magnificent!
Blue-Eyes Ultimate Dragon

00:20:57.060 --> 00:20:58.800
Duel, standby!

00:21:02.860 --> 00:21:11.260
The flask glistens

00:21:12.300 --> 00:21:19.110
Wait for me in the science classroom

00:21:19.600 --> 00:21:28.080
If we put our cold hands together

00:21:28.780 --> 00:21:35.860
And rub them together, they become warm

00:21:37.560 --> 00:21:41.690
Shower of happiness

00:21:41.980 --> 00:21:45.800
I will shower you with it

00:21:46.130 --> 00:21:54.070
I will support you even when you feel lonely

00:21:54.270 --> 00:21:58.310
Shower of happiness

00:21:58.580 --> 00:22:02.440
You are not alone

00:22:02.820 --> 00:22:09.160
You're protected by a giant ring of friendship
